// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1879360884" "PBAoE, Heal (Self and Allies), HoT (Self and Allies), +RES(Slow, Regen Debuff)"
// Power Help Text :
"P637007078" "You mend the wounds of yourself and nearby allies by placing your bodies in a past or future state where they are far less injured.  Temporal Mending will immediately heal its targets and continue to heal them for an equal amount over the next 6 seconds.  Additionally, affected allies will gain some resistance to slow effects and regeneration debuffs.  Allies affected by the Accelerated effect will receive additional healing from this power.  Temporal Mending will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2008805399" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} health with {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4030956178" "{PlayerSource} continually heals you for {Damage} health with {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Stop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3346447298" "Ancestral Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3573600817" "Ranged, Hold(Foe), -Regen(Foe), -Heal(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P282810155" "You trap your target within the flow of time causing them to be held helpless. Even those resistant to the effects of Time Stop's hold will still have their regeneration rate and healing effects reduced for a brief period."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2288338409" "Hold, -Heal, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2822815567" "You have been held. Your healing effects and regeneration rate have also been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P913352454" "{PlayerSource} holds you with {PowerName} and reduces your regeneration rate and healing!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slowed Response 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3621625843" "Curse of Weariness"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2384299496" "TAoE, -DEF(Foe,All), -RES(Foe,All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3608045552" "You manipulate time around a targeted foe causing their reflexes to become slowed and sluggish.  This causes them to have decreased defense and damage resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P547966435" "-DEF(All), -RES(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3291922931" "Your defenses and resistances have been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1053043220" "{PlayerSource} debilitates you, causing a {PowerName} which reduces your defenses and resistance to all forms of damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2794663378" "Ancestral Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P887700718" "Ranged, High DMG(Energy), -End (Foe), -Rec (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2021166200" "You strike your target with a powerful lightning bolt from the sky, dealing energy damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P927642709" "-End, -Rec"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3186021941" "Your recovery has been reduced and your endurance is being drained."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4138119290" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with her {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P578311566" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} drains some of your Endurance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4069553316" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} reduces your recovery!"

